@startuml Current_Lead_Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
skinparam noteBorderColor #4F7F52
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title Innova AI — путь пользовательского сообщения и защита ПД

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "Widget / Telegram /\nAPI client" as Client
participant "FastAPI router" as Router
participant "AgentService" as Agent
participant "PiiSanitizer" as PII
database "PostgreSQL + pgvector" as PG
participant "KnowledgeRetrievalService" as Retrieval
participant "Embedding Client" as Embedding
participant "Main LLM\nAG2 adapter" as LLM
participant "OpenRouter" as OpenRouter
participant "State Machine" as SM
queue "Redis / Celery broker" as Redis
participant "Celery Worker" as Worker
participant "LeadDeliveryService" as Delivery
participant "AmoCRM / Webhook / Fake" as CRM

note over User, CRM
  CURRENT STATE 29.10.2026
end note

== 1. Приём и локальная подготовка ==

User -> Client : Текст или Telegram contact
note right of Client
  Telegram contact пока преобразуется в текст:
  "Мой телефон: +7999..."

  Telegram /start обрабатывается
  коннектором локально и не входят
  в показанный ниже POST /message flow.
end note

Client -> Router : POST /message\nanonymous_id, session_id,\nchannel, content, page_title
Router -> Router : Pydantic validation
Router -> Agent : handle_message(request)

Agent -> Agent : normalize(content)
Agent -> PG : get_or_create anonymous user\nand active dialog session
PG --> Agent : user, session
Agent -> PG : load lead + last 20 messages
PG --> Agent : qualification, contact,\nraw local history

Agent -> PII : seed_contacts(lead.contact)
Agent -> PII : sanitize every history message
PII --> Agent : history with stable tokens
Agent -> PII : sanitize current content
PII --> Agent : safe_content + local_contact\n+ contact_only flag
Agent -> PII : sanitize qualification,\npage_title
PII --> Agent : safe context values

note right of PII
  Example:
  "+7 (999) 123-45-67" -> [PHONE_1]
  "user@example.com"   -> [EMAIL_1]

  Реальные значения возвращаются AgentService
  отдельно от AI payload и не передаются
  в embeddings или основной LLM.
end note

Agent -> PG : INSERT raw user message
note right of PG
  Raw-текст остаётся в локальной БД.
  При повторном использовании история
  снова проходит через PiiSanitizer.
end note

== 2. Выбор пути ==

alt Сообщение содержит только контакт
  Agent -> Agent : skip retrieval; use empty KB context

else Обычное или смешанное сообщение
  == 2A. RAG retrieval ==

  Agent -> Retrieval : retrieve(safe_content)
  Retrieval -> PII : sanitize current query
  PII --> Retrieval : safe query
  Retrieval -> Embedding : embed([safe query])
  Embedding -> PII : ensure_safe(texts)

  alt Guard обнаружил поддерживаемые ПД
    PII --> Embedding : PiiDetectedError
    Embedding --> Retrieval : exception; HTTP не выполняется
    Retrieval --> Agent : empty chunks
  else Payload безопасен
    Embedding -> OpenRouter : embeddings request
    OpenRouter --> Embedding : query vector
    Embedding --> Retrieval : query vector
    Retrieval -> PG : pgvector top-k search
    PG --> Retrieval : chunks + scores
    Retrieval -> Retrieval : keep score >= min_score
    Retrieval --> Agent : chunks from matching documents
  end

  Agent -> PII : sanitize_knowledge_text(formatted chunks)
  PII --> Agent : safe context + KB_CONTACT token map
end

== 2B. Основное решение LLM для всех сообщений ==

  Agent -> LLM : decide(safe current message,\nsafe history, safe qualification,\nsafe RAG context, safe page title)
  LLM -> PII : ensure_safe(all outbound messages)

  alt Guard обнаружил поддерживаемые ПД
    PII --> LLM : PiiDetectedError
    LLM --> Agent : safe fallback AgentDecision\nHTTP не выполняется
  else Payload безопасен
    PII --> LLM : OK
    LLM -> OpenRouter : chat completion
    OpenRouter --> LLM : JSON response
    LLM --> Agent : AgentDecision\nor safe timeout/parse fallback
  end

  opt Backend отклонил ошибочный старт qualification
    note right of Agent
      Возможен один corrective retry.
      Он проходит через тот же LLM ensure_safe().
      Если коррекция снова нарушает контракт,
      API возвращает 502 без сохранения этого хода.
    end note
  end

  Agent -> Agent : ignore LLM extracted_contact;\nuse only local_contact
  Agent -> PII : sanitize final answer and lead_summary
  PII --> Agent : safe answer + safe summary
  Agent -> Agent : restore only current KB_CONTACT tokens in answer

== 3. Локальная бизнес-логика и сохранение ==

Agent -> SM : apply qualification patch\n+ merge local contact\n+ resolve transition
SM --> Agent : validated next state
Agent -> Agent : contact refusal / opt-out logic\n+ compute missing fields

Agent -> PG : INSERT assistant message with public KB contacts
Agent -> PG : UPDATE session state,\nflags, closed_at
Agent -> PII : sanitize new or existing summary
PII --> Agent : summary without real contacts
Agent -> PG : UPSERT lead draft\nqualification + real local contact\n+ safe summary

alt Backend confirms LEAD_READY
  Agent -> PG : UPDATE lead status = ready
end

Agent -> PG : COMMIT

opt Lead became ready and delivery is enabled
  Agent -> Redis : send_task deliver_lead(str(lead_id))\nqueue innova.lead_delivery
end

Agent --> Router : AgentMessageResponse
Router --> Client : HTTP 200
Client --> User : Ответ ассистента

== 4. Асинхронная доставка лида ==

Redis --> Worker : JSON task: deliver_lead(lead_id)
Worker -> Delivery : deliver(lead_id, raise_on_delivery_error=True)
Delivery -> PG : SELECT lead FOR NO KEY UPDATE\ncheck status and previous attempt
PG --> Delivery : qualification + real contact\n+ safe summary

note over Delivery, CRM #FFF8E1
  AmoCRM / настроенный CRM — разрешённый получатель контакта.
  Этот путь не проходит через OpenRouter.
end note

alt Already delivered
  Delivery --> Worker : existing result, no CRM call
else Previous unconfirmed attempt or needs_review
  Delivery -> PG : preserve / set needs_review\nCOMMIT if changed
  Delivery --> Worker : stop without CRM call
else Delivery is permitted
  Delivery -> PG : INSERT lead_delivery_attempts\nseparate connection and COMMIT
  Delivery -> CRM : deliver_lead(payload)
  alt CRM confirmed success
    CRM --> Delivery : success
    Delivery -> PG : status = delivered, error = null\nDELETE attempt
  else Connection failure / confirmed rejection
    CRM --> Delivery : exception
    Delivery -> PG : status = delivery_failed, error\nDELETE attempt
  else Unconfirmed result
    CRM --> Delivery : exception
    Delivery -> PG : status = needs_review, error\nKEEP attempt
  end
  Delivery -> PG : COMMIT status + attempt change atomically
  Delivery --> Worker : result / re-raise exception
end

Worker -> Redis : ACK after execution / publish bounded retry

note over Worker, PG #FFF8E1
  Child SIGKILL: reject_on_worker_lost requeues task.
  The committed attempt survives rollback.
  Redelivery stops at needs_review without a second CRM call.
end note

@enduml
